# ==========================================
# ROLE-BASED STATUS UPDATE TESTS
# ==========================================

### TEST 1: Update status with DeputyManager role (should succeed)
### Prerequisites: 
### - Login with DeputyManager, Manager, CEO, Admin, or Root role
### - Get token and set it in @token variable
### - Shipment must be in valid state for progression (e.g., InPreparation → AwaitingPickup)
PATCH {{Backend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Shipments/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 2
}

###

### TEST 2: Update status with ShopAssistant role (should return 403 Forbidden)
### Prerequisites:
### - Login with ShopAssistant, Marketer, or ITTechnician role
### - Get token and set it in @token variable below
@shopAssistantToken = your_shop_assistant_jwt_token_here

PATCH {{Backend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Shipments/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{shopAssistantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 2
}
# Expected: 403 Forbidden (user lacks permission)

###

# ==========================================
# STATUS PROGRESSION VALIDATION TESTS
# ==========================================

### TEST 3: Valid forward progression (InPreparation → AwaitingPickup)
### Prerequisites: Shipment must have required fields (dimensions, addresses)
PATCH {{Backend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Shipments/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 2
}
# Expected: 204 No Content (success)

###

### TEST 4: Invalid backward progression (InTransit → InPreparation)
### Prerequisites: Shipment must currently be at InTransit status
PATCH {{Backend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Shipments/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 1
}
# Expected: 409 Conflict - "Invalid status transition from InTransit to InPreparation. Status can only progress forward in the workflow."

###

### TEST 5: Valid skip progression (InPreparation → InTransit)
### Prerequisites: Shipment must have required fields
PATCH {{Backend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Shipments/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 3
}
# Expected: 204 No Content (success - can skip intermediate statuses)

###

### TEST 6: Cancel from any status (valid)
PATCH {{Backend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Shipments/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 6
}
# Expected: 204 No Content (Cancelled can be set from any non-terminal status)

###

### TEST 7: Returned from InTransit (valid)
### Prerequisites: Shipment must be at InTransit or Delivered status
PATCH {{Backend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Shipments/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 7
}
# Expected: 204 No Content (Returned valid from InTransit/Delivered)

###

### TEST 8: Returned from InPreparation (invalid)
### Prerequisites: Shipment must be at InPreparation status
PATCH {{Backend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Shipments/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 7
}
# Expected: 409 Conflict - "Invalid status transition from InPreparation to Returned. Status can only progress forward in the workflow."

###

### TEST 9: Collected for Incoming shipment (valid)
### Prerequisites: 
### - Shipment type = 1 (Incoming)
### - Shipment status = 4 (Delivered)
PATCH {{Backend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Shipments/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 5
}
# Expected: 204 No Content (Collected valid for incoming shipments after Delivered)

###

### TEST 10: Collected for Outgoing shipment (invalid)
### Prerequisites:
### - Shipment type = 2 (Outgoing)
### - Shipment status = 4 (Delivered)
PATCH {{Backend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Shipments/2/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 5
}
# Expected: 409 Conflict - "Invalid status transition from Delivered to Collected. Status can only progress forward in the workflow."

###

### TEST 11: Change from terminal status (invalid)
### Prerequisites: Shipment must be at Cancelled, Returned, or Collected status
PATCH {{Backend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Shipments/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 3
}
# Expected: 409 Conflict - "Invalid status transition from Cancelled to InTransit. Status can only progress forward in the workflow."

###

### TEST 12: Missing required fields (dimensions)
### Prerequisites: Shipment at InPreparation with no dimensions set
PATCH {{Backend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Shipments/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 2
}
# Expected: 409 Conflict - "Cannot update status: weight is required"

###

### TEST 13: Same status (no change)
PATCH {{Backend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Shipments/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 1
}
# Expected: 204 No Content (same status is allowed, no-op)

