# ==========================================
# EVENTS API TESTS
# ==========================================

### Get all events (with pagination and filters)
GET {{Backend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Events?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get all events with status filter
GET {{Backend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Events?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10&status=Published
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get event by ID
GET {{Backend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a new event
POST {{Backend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Event",
  "description": "This is a test event description",
  "dateOfEvent": "2026-02-15T18:00:00Z",
  "image": null,
  "addressId": 1,
  "createdByUserId": 1
}

###

### Update event
PUT {{Backend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Event Title",
  "description": "Updated event description",
  "dateOfEvent": "2026-02-20T19:00:00Z",
  "image": null
}

###

### Publish event (changes status from Created to Published)
### Requires: event must have an image uploaded
PUT {{Backend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Events/1/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Cancel event (changes status to Canceled)
PUT {{Backend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Events/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Delete event
DELETE {{Backend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

